OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's solar farm legal
OL,4,Achallenge moves ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has decided to move forward
OL,7,Fwith an application to challenge the
OL,8,Fgovernment's approval of a large solar
OL,9,Ffarm.
OL,11,FLast month the government authorised
OL,12,Fthe construction of Green Hill Solar
OL,13,FFarm, a development covering 2,965
OL,14,Facres (1,200 hectares) of land spanning
OL,15,FBuckinghamshire, the south and west of
OL,16,FWellingborough and north of
OL,17,FNorthampton.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
