OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's solar farm legal
OL,4,Achallenge moves ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Northamptonshire Council said it
OL,7,Fhad "considered its legal position and
OL,8,Fhas decided to proceed to a judicial
OL,9,Freview application focusing on the
OL,10,Fnegative impacts such a development
OL,11,Fwould have on the unique heritage of
OL,12,Four area".
OL,14,FIsland Green Power, the project's
OL,15,Fdeveloper, said it would "participate
OL,16,Fin the process".
